  "consolidated_heads": {
    "B50.0": {
      "change": "A0 scaffold: the 12 B50-alpha inputs appended after Ledger_Mode (Engine_Mode default Engine_Grid, the single, clock and rollover inputs at their B49a-reproducing defaults), TF_D1 appended to ENUM_MODE_TFs, the NY clock and single-trade stubs, the OnTesterInit default for an omitted B50 axis (GOAT-EA#269 P1)",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#269 (claude-mac/b50-a0)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (B50-alpha, Track B: 6433781951 / 6433796100; integration GOAT-EA#277)"
    },
    "B50.0b": {
      "change": "A0 follow-up: the entry block holds through the Delay_Trade virtual-to-real promotion; the NY clock refuses pre-2007 tester history for the Fixed and EUDST models",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#275 (claude-mac/b50-a0-fix2)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (B50-alpha, Track B: 6433781951 / 6433796100; integration GOAT-EA#277)"
    },
    "B50.1": {
      "change": "A1 single core: GoatSingleOpen opens one ATR-stopped position per signal episode under Engine_Single (RiskperSeq sized from tick value / tick size only, floored to the step, refused below the minimum; TP from R or ATR; the stop and TP clear the stops level), following Add_Level's order; re-armed on the signal's false edge (Release cross-review GOAT-EA#272)",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#272 (claude-mac/b50-a1r)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (B50-alpha, Track B: 6433781951 / 6433796100; integration GOAT-EA#277)"
    },
    "B50.2": {
      "change": "A2 New York clock: DST, the server-clock models (NY-close, fixed, EU DST), the NY session, the rollover block and the live self-check; the Friday close fires at the earlier of the session end or Friday 16:55 NY; the FX trade-date convention",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#273 (claude-mac/b50-a2r)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (B50-alpha, Track B: 6433781951 / 6433796100; integration GOAT-EA#277)"
    },
    "B50.3": {
      "change": "A3 single exits: the opposite-signal exit, the time stop (retried every tick until it closes), and the FastSpeed bypass under Engine_Single",
      "pr": "algogoat/GOAT-EA#274 (claude-mac/b50-a3r)",
      "coordination": "algogoat/goatai#2587 (B50-alpha, Track B: 6433781951 / 6433796100; integration GOAT-EA#277)"
    }
  },
  "change": "B49a plus B50-alpha (research only: no admission, no live arm): the single-trade engine (Engine_Single) with ATR stops, R/ATR take-profits, the opposite-signal exit and the time stop; D1; the New York clock with server-clock models, the NY session and the rollover block. Every input defaults to B49a's behaviour (Engine_Grid, Clock_Server, zero sizes), so flags off is B49a; every changed line since B49a is marked B50 (scripts/test_b50_no_drift.cjs); the input header gains 12 appended inputs and TF_D1, so B50 batch packages carry its own header pin.",
